      "section_path": [
        "Part-Time Employment Contract B"
      ],
      "text": "PeopleFlow Demonstration Services offers [PERSON] employment in the Operations team from 2026-09-01 on the following part-time terms. The role comprises administrative service work and reports to the assigned team manager.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
